297:2. Arbabshirani MR , Kiehl KA, Pearlson GD, Calhoun VD. 2013. Classification of schizophrenia patients based on resting-  state functional network connectivity. Frontiers in Neuroscience 7 :133. DOI: https://doi.org/10.3389/ fnins.2013.00133, PMID: 23966903

